WEBVTT

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.710
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.800
Are you all right?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.840
My body melted a bit in the fog,
but the leaves are safe, so it's okay.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.800
You scared us.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.470
We were going to eat it,
but it ate you instead.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.060
I should've been careful.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.730
You're looking like an airhead as usual.
Glad you're okay.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.020
Hey!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.320
We're safe for now.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.280
Yes, the red fog should lift before long.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.780
So, what do we do with him?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.410
Yeah, I knew that was coming...

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.370
What is he anyway?

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.330
No idea, huh.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.540
I'm human!

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.920
Seems like we can exterminate him
in the red fog.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.510
So he's not a bug?

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:53.260
H-Human...

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.550
But Rinayo-chan was saved thanks to him.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.970
I live to protect you all.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:02.720
I'll exterminate anything
that threatens you.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:05.560
I'll do it for Ryo and the others.

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:07.980
But then again...

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:12.360
he found the Red Bug before Sis and I did.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.780
He might know something about bugs.

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.610
Let's let him live for now.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.830
We can exterminate him anytime.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.710
Can I ask you a favor then?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.620
The view up here is a bit too nice...

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:32.130
My feet are dangling,
and, well, it's a bit too high...

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:34.920
Sis.

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:37.880
There you are.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.310
Phew, I'm saved.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.970
That was the scariest thing today.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:46.890
Oh! Is this another Kemurikusa?

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.570
Sis, let's talk about what to do next.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:55.690
Okay.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:59.450
Rina, keep an eye on him.
But don't touch him, he's dangerous.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.070
Toss him in the fog if need be.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.280
Gotcha!

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:12.500
We're done collecting the water.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.380
Are you sure you don't need
any water yet?

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.220
Yeah, I only used Midori, so I'm fine.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.470
Ai-chan's movement...

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:27.180
So this really is the last
of the water on this island.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.020
We need to use it sparingly.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:34.520
With this much water,
we can go search again.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.110
What do you think?

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:42.870
Before, we didn't have enough water,
so we decided to stay here till the end.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:48.160
I thought about it,
and I think you should make the decision.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.920
Whether we stay or go,
you're the one who has to fight.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.210
I want to do what you want to do.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:59.170
I don't have any desires unlike you guys.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.470
So you choose, Sis.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:06.350
No, Rin. If I die,
you'll be the eldest here.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.850
You need to get used to making decisions.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.650
I told you not to say stuff like that.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.310
Give it a thought.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.070
With this much water,
we can wait for your decision for 5 days.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.360
Okay.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.490
I'll think about it.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.370
Oh yes, could you go pick some Kiiro?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:32.290
Okay, I'll check to see if there are
any small Red Bugs left too.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.630
And now...

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.880
Him, huh.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.170
He's not as threatening
as a big bug for now.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.180
He's pretty weak too.
Rina could probably beat him alone.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.470
What are you doing?

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.010
But...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.390
But what?

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.940
My body is feeling a bit strange.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.650
Strange? How so?

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.480
I'm not sure if it's related,

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.280
but my face feels hot
depending on the distance and time.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:06.780
My heart beats faster.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:11.660
It feels bright and my vision
gets blurry at times too.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.420
This has never happened before.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.170
Is it something serious?

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.420
I don't think so, not for the moment.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.130
Do you think...

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:27.050
it could be poison?

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:31.100
You mean, the thing
Ryoku-chan told us about?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:36.690
Yeah. Ryoku said that
a poisonous Red Bug might appear some day.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.770
It kicks in a little while
after you fight it.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.190
It remains even after the bug is dead.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.610
Does it hurt?

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.280
It's not like that, at least for now.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:50.580
Riku would've known what this feeling was.

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.580
When does it happen?

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.370
When I'm close to him or when I see him.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.790
It also happens a bit
when I talk about him.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:03.880
I might be just imagining it,
but please be careful, Sis.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.680
I'll go pick some Kiiro now.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:11.810
Okay. I don't sense any big Red Bugs,
but be careful.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.390
I will. Let me know if something happens.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.690
Of course.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.660
Um, where are we going?

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.490
Shut up and walk.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.700
She still doesn't trust me.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:36.370
Am I going to be exterminated?

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.670
This is it!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.840
This is what I saw when I fell.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:49.720
This is so amazing. So interesting.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.100
Midori's roots.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.600
Wow.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:56.230
It moves sometimes.
Is it connected to Ritsu-san?

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:57.230
Yes.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.310
So cool.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.020
It goes this way...

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:05.440
Oh! It even goes between that small crack.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.610
Wow, so interesting.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.200
I see...

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:14.700
And it goes this way, and then...

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.920
Stop moving around.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.040
S-Sorry.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.340
Oh, it's so pretty.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.180
Is this Kemurikusa too?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.680
Yes, but we can't use it.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.310
Oh...

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.190
You're right, it's hardly glowing.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.690
How is it different from Midori-san's?

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:45.530
They're different colors.
Come on, let's go.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.950
Can I take these back with me?

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:51.990
Suit yourself.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:53.530
Yes!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.670
What's wrong?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:15.680
That... It's a bug, isn't it?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.100
The color is different. It won't attack.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:29.440
You're right.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.370
How strange.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.560
Thank you...

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.730
Is that a Red Bug?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.900
And is that the green Kemurikusa?

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.400
Amazing!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:12.610
You're right,
the glow is totally different.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.860
The color, huh.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.700
I wonder if this can glow too.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.620
So interesting.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.920
He really doesn't die.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.920
Instead, it heals his cuts.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.430
He's neither Red Bug nor human.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.640
What is he?

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.060
Um...

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.150
Are you going to exterminate me?

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.030
So, have you remembered anything?

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.700
No, I don't remember a thing.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.750
Where did you come from, and how?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.540
I remembered the name, but...

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:15.510
That better be true.
Tell me everything you know right now.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.970
It's true. I swear!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:23.180
I can't remember what I did yesterday
or what I was trying to do.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.190
Aren't you scared?

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.690
Come to think of it, I'm not.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.270
I was too busy
being scared of other things.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.490
Sorry.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:38.780
And maybe because it's fun
with all these interesting things.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.830
And I'm glad I met you all, Rin-san.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:46.710
If I were alone here, I would've
been killed by a Red Bug by now.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.590
Let's go.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:11.650
Sis, can you hear me?
I'm at the Kiiro place.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:15.150
It's safe,
so I'm going to collect some now.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.820
Okay, take your time.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.970
Why are you staring?

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.890
Oh! I'm sorry.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:52.310
I'd never seen this before,
so I'm curious.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.770
So this is what you came here for.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.240
Wow, this is great.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.780
It looks a bit like Midori-san.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.700
But is this one a bit withered?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:06.490
Is there anything I can do to help?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.830
No, just stay put.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.120
Okay.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:22.340
This place is full of mysterious things.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.550
This island is relatively quiet.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.140
Wait, there are other islands?

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.770
That's so interesting.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:35.020
-Have you been to them?
-I have.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.240
Wow. What's it like? Why'd you go there?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.870
There's a lot of Red Bugs.
And the red fog.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.700
The six of us went to find water.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:50.160
Oh. Did you discover anything?

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.620
Yes, thanks to everyone.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:57.130
About letters, how to defeat bugs,
where the water is...

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.340
Midori too.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.170
Wow, all important things.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.720
Yes, thanks to that,
we've been able to survive.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.970
The situation is still bad.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:11.310
But I want my sisters to spend the rest
of their time doing what they like.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:15.440
Of course, Sis loves Midori
a bit too much though.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:21.240
Are you trying to figure out
what our special powers are?

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:25.030
Of course not! I'm just curious.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:30.950
Rin-san, Ritsu-san,
and the Rina-sans with the same faces...

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:35.250
Rinacchi, Rinaji, Rinayo, and Rinamu.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:39.130
They protect what I can't on my own.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.630
So the Rina-sans like to eat?

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.890
Yes, not that I understand it.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.300
You don't?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.810
What my sisters like helps us to survive.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:53.690
They're a great help.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.230
You have a great relationship.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.190
And what do you like, Rin-san?

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:07.200
Nothing. I only care about
protecting my sisters.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.790
Protect? From the Red Bugs?

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:14.660
Yes, and the red fog and lack of water.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.290
I have many concerns.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:21.050
I can't make the wrong decision again.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:25.090
Should we stay or
leave the island for water?

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:27.680
I see.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.890
But...

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:35.060
once you clear all that,
you can do what you like to do too.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:40.440
Impossible. It's a waste
to even think about it.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:45.450
Yeah, it's not that simple, huh. Sorry.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:47.200
Oh, but!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:52.200
If there's anything I can do,
let me know.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.620
I'll do anything.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:56.580
Scouting for bugs, cleaning...

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.840
Oh, but only things that
won't hurt or kill me, please.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.630
I don't understand him.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:08.380
He's so weak, yet he's oddly strong,
so optimistic.

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:13.850
And this feeling.
What in the world is this?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.690
Rin-san, is that...

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:27.490
We're going back.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:30.990
Wait, hold on...

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.960
Rin, Wakaba-kun. Welcome back.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:45.090
Thank you. How was it?

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:50.640
There was a small Red Bug,
but that was it.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.600
Nothing strange either.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.810
Nothing except him.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:03.150
Yeah, he sure is strange.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:06.110
He's harmless for now...

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.360
I think.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:17.660
Wakaba-kun, what's that
you have on your waist?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:19.710
Huh? My waist?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:27.000
Whoa, what's happening?
It's totally glowing.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.470
The Kemurikusa you just picked.
When did it start glowing?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.430
It wasn't shining when you picked it?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:34.600
No.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.560
Is this safe? Is it okay to hold?

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:45.190
It's rare for leaves other than
Midori-chan's to change its glow.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:48.900
When did it start doing that?
Did you do something?

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.740
I don't know.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:57.080
Is it okay to hold this?
It won't explode, will it?

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.160
Rin, what color is that?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.420
Blue, I think. I've never used it before.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:06.590
Wow! When's the last time
we found a new color?

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.880
Huh? It stopped glowing.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.380
That's how it is, then.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.050
What are those used for?

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.510
Watch.

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:23.230
Kiiro leaves stay bright even after
you pick them, so we use them for light.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.520
-For dark places.
-And nighttime.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.610
That's right.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.320
I see.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.650
You don't know anything, do you?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:37.160
But that means I get to learn
lots of new things.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.120
So it's really fun.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:50.050
Oh, fine then.
Rina will teach you everything.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:51.510
I guess we must.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:52.840
Sis.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.180
Let's leave the island.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.940
Did you see something?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.150
No, nothing.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.150
But let's give it another try.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.360
Something might be different.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.280
And...

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.990
I have a feeling
we might discover something new.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:23.120
All right then, let's get to it.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.210
Rina-chans, time to start packing.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.210
-What for?
-Not sure, but okay!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.880
Huh? What's going on? What are we doing?

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:35.840
One, two. One, two.

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:38.430
-Like this?
-Perfect.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:46.020
Maybe this route would be safer.
I'll decide the rest on site.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.320
We're ready to go.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.190
The water is tied down.

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:57.110
The lid's closed tight too.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.490
Where should we head?

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.120
We need to go to Island Two first.

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.710
There's no more water
all the way to Island Three.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.710
-Let's cross the bridge to Island Four.
-Okay.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:12.130
If we make it safely to Island Four...

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:15.340
Remember what Riku said
about beyond Island Six?

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.720
The lake.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.180
Lots of Red Bugs starting at Island Three.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:22.600
And there are no sure paths
from Island Four.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:27.230
Besides, we don't even know if
the paths up to there are still intact.

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:31.900
Don't worry.
Your decisions have always been right.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.900
Be confident.

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:39.410
And if it still gets tough,
we'll all do something about it.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.030
Thanks.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.410
Okay, let's go!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.120
All right!

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.700
-Here it comes.
-Here it is.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:31.500
Easy now, easy.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.510
All right!

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.220
Incredible!

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:50.730
Seems good.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.100
Yay!

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:54.940
The tracks are fine down to the exit.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:57.980
There.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:19:59.780
Okay, let's go.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:02.450
Yeah.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:04.660
Off we go!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.990
-Yay!
-Yay!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.050
Rinaji is smart and is on the lookout.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.880
Rinayo too. Rinayo too.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.300
I want to see too!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.800
Tracks, tracks.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:33.060
Oh wow! Moving such a huge object
with us still on it.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.650
Midori-san is so strong.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:37.690
Hey.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.820
This is amazing, Rin-san.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.780
The view is so wonderful like this.

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.950
-Stop moving around.
-Yes.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.830
There's something I must say
before we leave.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:50.660
Y-Yes?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:21:00.880
You mean, is it time to exterminate me?

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.260
I don't trust you.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.640
Do anything funny,
and I'll exterminate you.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:10.350
Don't forget that.

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:13.600
But...

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:17.480
you were what triggered this expedition.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.980
And thanks to you, Rinayo was saved.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:23.900
Thanks.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:31.660
N-nah, I didn't do anything.
I don't even get what's going on.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:35.870
I'm just glad if it
helped you out in some way.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.000
But why all of a sudden?

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:42.590
Somebody usually dies
when we leave the island.

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:46.630
You'll probably die first,
so I thought I'd tell you.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:55.600
What, seriously? It's that dangerous?
We could die?

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.100
But I want to see what it's like.

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:00.820
No, but I don't want to die!

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:04.030
I totally can't make up my mind!

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:08.780
Let's go.

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:18.170
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:25.050
Long night will continue on

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:28.630
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:31.930
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:51.490
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:58.160
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:05.250
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:23:05.420 --> 00:23:13.100
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:20.140
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:27.320
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:33.660
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:37.370
Endless agony

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:40.870
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA
